    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Griffin, battle tank has been developed as countermeasure against powerful neighbor countries. However, its designer was captured by the enemy country...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, his granddaughter got into the Griffin and take on her solo mission to rescue her grandfather!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind/Fast-forward: The player can use the rewind or fast-forward functions to complete the mission perfectly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving Option: The player can save its progress anytime/anywhere and restart the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Screen Filter: Retro, Black-White, and more filtering functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Gallery: Manuals and package design for the original version are available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat Mode: Make the gameplay easier with cheat mode (infinity life, invincible etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jukebox: You can play the in-game music (5 tracks) at any time.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Griffin, battle tank has been developed as countermeasure against powerful neighbor countries. However, its designer was captured by the enemy country...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, his granddaughter got into the Griffin and take on her solo mission to rescue her grandfather!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind/Fast-forward: The player can use the rewind or fast-forward functions to complete the mission perfectly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving Option: The player can save its progress anytime/anywhere and restart the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Screen Filter: Retro, Black-White, and more filtering functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Gallery: Manuals and package design for the original version are available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat Mode: Make the gameplay easier with cheat mode (infinity life, invincible etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jukebox: You can play the in-game music (5 tracks) at any time.</p></li></ul>",
